    "reviewer_repair_closure": [
      "_load_generator unwraps EngineService/SubmitPollTextGenerator to the owner defining _ensure_runner, requires a cold runner, sets the logits-row bound before _ensure_runner, and keeps LLM lifetime explicit with exception-safe close.",
      "No launcher replacement: capture observes the actual launcher code object via sys.setprofile on the return event, leaves selection launchers and their arguments unchanged, and restores the previous profiler.",
      "block_start is part of the capture identity, so the two distinct 3073:1 blocks at starts 1024 and 2048 no longer collide; reconcile_capture_sites reports planned/captured/missing with reasons.",
      "install() is transactional and rolls back every applied patch if any step raises; restore() is idempotent; cleanup errors are surfaced without replacing a primary failure.",
      "Plan uses the runner's actual max_block and reports a nondefault --max-block mismatch instead of planning from the CLI value."
    ],
    "device_identity_gate": "require_expected_device needs a live device name and PCI bus id and fails early unless the name contains 'AMD Radeon Pro W7900'; environment text is not treated as physical-device proof.",
